    <div class="badge amber">Private-preview draft · legal review required</div>
    <p><strong>Last updated:</strong> August 28, 2026.</p>
    <h2>Informational purpose</h2>
    <p>The website provides general information about Trouvus, its services, research and frameworks. It does not constitute legal, financial, investment or other regulated professional advice.</p>
    <h2>No engagement created</h2>
    <p>Viewing the website, requesting information or exchanging preliminary correspondence does not create a consulting relationship. An engagement begins only when both parties execute an appropriate written agreement.</p>
    <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
    <p>Unless otherwise stated, website content, Trouvus frameworks, diagrams and branding are owned by or licensed to Trouvus. They may not be reproduced or used commercially without written permission. Reasonable quotation with attribution is permitted where allowed by law.</p>
    <h2>Third-party sources and links</h2>
    <p>Research references and external links are provided for context. Trouvus does not control third-party services and is not responsible for their availability, security or content.</p>
    <h2>Limitations</h2>
    <p>Trouvus works to keep website information accurate and current but does not warrant that every item is complete or error-free. Use of the website is at your own risk to the extent permitted by applicable law.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
